[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0010","text":"阳希酱，我看了你聊舞蹈的\n那个采访视频哦──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0020","text":"哇～！　谢谢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0030","text":"那个啊，聊了好多呢\n最近跳舞也越来越开心了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0040","text":"羽那酱也又登上杂志了呢！\n我马上去买了哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0050","text":"大家各自都有工作邀约来了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0060","text":"CoMETIK的演唱会，\n看来反响很强烈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0070","text":"是这样啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0080","text":"……但是\n那场演唱会，真的很开心呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0090","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0100","text":"就像置身梦境一样……\n那么快乐……虽然不想让它结束——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0110","text":"但是我在结束的那一刻，却莫名地……感到开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0120","text":"……？\n为什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0130","text":"因为我在想，接下来会发生什么呢\n会有什么样的景色在等着我们呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0140","text":"哈哈……是吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0150","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0160","text":"喂——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0170","text":"你们要废话到什么时候"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0180","text":"要是光说些没用的我就回去了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0190","text":"等、等等！　说、说得也是！\n好，我们继续谈正事吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_99_0200","text":"是关于CoMETIK的下一场演唱会的事————"}]
